  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>**구글드라이브에 자료 공유합니다.&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eEVzYZy4tvUjrQ-1arVBbajY5hMk2Swr/view?usp=sharing</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26428052237f62e620c68b7c7e8c8999af540794?download\" data-file-name=\"1-1 여러단계로구성된생물의몸.show\" data-file-size=\"4926612\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftshow\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D391%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20210818060347&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F26428052237f62e620c68b7c7e8c8999af540794')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">1-1 여러단계로구성된생물의몸</span><span class=\"type\">.show</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.70MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이제서야 1차시 준비ㅜㅜ</p><p>너무 오랜만에 영상을 만들었더니 엄청 어색어색합니다...</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/qbWykd9k2Kc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/qbWykd9k2Kc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qbWykd9k2Kc&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bmPr18/hyLgL4sNDa/bhOWSLyhuq9PMPu7MEILPk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qbWykd9k2Kc\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>근데... 다 하고 나서 보니...&quot;생물체의 구성단계&quot;를 아는게 성취기준인데</p><p>너무 동물에 대해서만 이야기를 했는지... 좀 부족한거 같은데.. 으 다시 하지는 못하겠네요...</p><p>수업시간에 좀 더 이야기하는 걸로요...</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
